An existing file path with `[id]` is taken literally and outlined in file mode, not matched as a glob pattern.
== args
input/app/[id]/page.md
== file input/app/[id]/page.md
---
description: Product detail page.
---
# Page
== stdout
input/app/[id]/page.md (4 lines)
description: "Product detail page."
[L4-L4] # Page
== stderr
== exit 0
